{
  "id": "the-simpsons---6x25---who-shot-mr-burns",
  "title": "The Simpsons - 6x25 - Who Shot Mr Burns (Part One)",
  "sourceFilename": "The Simpsons - 6x25 - Who Shot Mr. Burns  (1).en.srt",
  "importedAt": "2026-09-19T20:06:11.738Z",
  "lineCount": 247,
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "Who Shot Mr. Burns? (Part One)",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 3874,
      "endMs": 5519
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "Is there nothing so intoxicating as the school hallway at early morn?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 32801,
      "endMs": 37935
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "The school normally doesn't smell so rank.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 39076,
      "endMs": 42096
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "Washbasin fresh. That funk must be coming from one of the classrooms.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 43472,
      "endMs": 47801
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "Poor fellow. Crushed by his own water bottle.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 51794,
      "endMs": 54411
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "Willie, sometime over the holiday weekend, the beloved grade-four gerbil...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 59311,
      "endMs": 63136
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "...Superdude, lost his life.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 63338,
      "endMs": 65083
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "I need you to air out the classroom and give Superdude a proper burial.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 65284,
      "endMs": 68707
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "You're lucky you're getting a decent burial.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 72398,
      "endMs": 74411
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "Me own father got thrown in the bog.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 74579,
      "endMs": 77230
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "What in the name of Saint Ephesiocritus...?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 79579,
      "endMs": 82566
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "What reeks?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 90989,
      "endMs": 92264
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "Smells like one of van Houten's. It does not.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 92465,
      "endMs": 96492
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "Miss Hoover, the floor is shaking.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 100116,
      "endMs": 102566
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "Ralph, remember the time you thought the...?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 102767,
      "endMs": 105385
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "Now, before we adjourn, I have one last matter of utmost importance.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 109109,
      "endMs": 113338
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "text": "I need to send this parcel with the profit projections to Pete Porter in Pasadena.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 113539,
      "endMs": 116861
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "text": "And it absolutely, positively, has to be there overnight.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 118312,
      "endMs": 122708
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "text": "Pete Porter. Pass it on. Pasadena. Promptly.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 123682,
      "endMs": 125796
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "text": "Package parcel processing.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 125963,
      "endMs": 127473
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "text": "Perk up. Package of plant profit projection for Pete Porter in Pasadena.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 127675,
      "endMs": 130997
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "text": "Priority? Precisely.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 131198,
      "endMs": 132876
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "text": "Here's your package, Mr. Burns.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 144118,
      "endMs": 146098
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "text": "My name is the return address, you senseless dunderpate.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 147809,
      "endMs": 150930
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "text": "Smithers, who is this nincompoop?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 151098,
      "endMs": 152675
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "text": "I've worked here for 10 years and my boss doesn't even know my name.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 153782,
      "endMs": 157138
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "text": "Well, that's gonna change right now.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 157306,
      "endMs": 159185
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "text": "My name is Homer J. Simp...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 159386,
      "endMs": 161400
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "text": "...son. - Sounded large when I ordered it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 161836,
      "endMs": 164520
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "text": "I can't make hide nor hair of these metric booby traps.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 164722,
      "endMs": 167843
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "text": "My Lord. Such destruction.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 168816,
      "endMs": 171702
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "text": "Superintendent Chalmers. How are you going?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 173413,
      "endMs": 175628
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "text": "Why is it when I heard the word \"school\" and the word \"exploded\"...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 175829,
      "endMs": 178984
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "text": "...I thought of the word \"Skinner\"?!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 179218,
      "endMs": 181131
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "text": "Congratulations, gentlemen. Your custodian struck oil.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 182037,
      "endMs": 184520
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "text": "You're standing on top of the richest elementary school in the state.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 184722,
      "endMs": 188447
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "text": "We also found this.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 188950,
      "endMs": 190594
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "text": "Thank you. Superdude.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 191333,
      "endMs": 193346
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "text": "A nonprofit organization with oil? I won't allow it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 201467,
      "endMs": 204151
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "text": "An oil well doesn't belong in the hands of...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 204319,
      "endMs": 206366
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "text": "...Betsy Bleeding-heart and Maynard G. Muskie-vote.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 206534,
      "endMs": 208950
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "text": "Sir, have you had enough exercise for this morning?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 209890,
      "endMs": 214151
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "text": "No.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 214353,
      "endMs": 215628
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "text": "Let's do another 20 miles.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 216366,
      "endMs": 218380
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "text": "I want that oil well. I've got a monopoly to maintain.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 339122,
      "endMs": 342042
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "text": "I own the electric company, waterworks, plus the hotel on Baltic Avenue.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 342209,
      "endMs": 345800
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "text": "That hotel's a dump and your monopoly's pathetic.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 346001,
      "endMs": 348250
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "text": "The oil well is not for sale, particularly to a black-hearted scoundrel like yourself.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 348417,
      "endMs": 352579
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "text": "I see.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 352780,
      "endMs": 354055
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "text": "Then I'll just have to attack you. I must have that oil.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 354223,
      "endMs": 359424
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "text": "Smithers. Smithers, help me subdue this beast.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 361337,
      "endMs": 365330
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "text": "Sorry, sir. This was all I could find. Take that. And that.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 365532,
      "endMs": 368686
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "text": "Please don't waste those.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 369995,
      "endMs": 372310
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "text": "I'm happy for the school.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 375438,
      "endMs": 376746
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "text": "Sounds like this money is gonna provide new opportunities.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 376948,
      "endMs": 379666
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "text": "Big deal. They didn't approve my idea. Said it was unfeasible.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 379867,
      "endMs": 383021
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "text": "It is unfeasible to resurrect the dead, Bart.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 383223,
      "endMs": 385337
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "text": "And even if the Three Stooges were alive, I doubt they'd hang out with you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 385505,
      "endMs": 388961
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "text": "I guess they'd wanna be with their families or something, huh?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 389196,
      "endMs": 392149
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "text": "Oh, I hate my job.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 392350,
      "endMs": 393894
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "text": "What's the point when your boss doesn't even remember your name?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 394062,
      "endMs": 396981
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "text": "I have an idea. What? What's your idea?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 397183,
      "endMs": 399599
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "text": "When my father was trying to catch my mother's eye...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 399800,
      "endMs": 402216
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "text": "...he sent her a box of candy with his photo.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 402384,
      "endMs": 404565
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "text": "After that, she never forgot him. That's all well and good.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 404733,
      "endMs": 407552
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "text": "But it's not really your idea, is it, now, Marge?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 407719,
      "endMs": 410538
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "text": "That's it. Frimble about with your widgets and doobobs.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 411277,
      "endMs": 415068
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "text": "It will all be a monument to futility when my plan comes to fruition.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 415236,
      "endMs": 418894
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "text": "Sir.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 419129,
      "endMs": 420438
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "text": "What I'm about to say violates every sycophantic urge in my body...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 420941,
      "endMs": 424062
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "text": "...but I wish you'd reconsider. This isn't a rival company...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 424230,
      "endMs": 427048
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "text": "...it's a school. They won't stand for it. - Pishposh.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 427183,
      "endMs": 430102
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "text": "It will be like taking candy from a baby.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 430270,
      "endMs": 432719
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "text": "Say, that sounds like a \"larf.\"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 432921,
      "endMs": 434867
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "text": "Let's try it right now.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 435102,
      "endMs": 437015
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "text": "There's candy right here. Why don't we eat this instead of stealing.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 438659,
      "endMs": 441847
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "text": "Oh, very well.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 442015,
      "endMs": 443626
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "text": "Oh, look. There's a photo in here. Oh, yes.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 448626,
      "endMs": 451277
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "text": "That's little Maggie Simpson, the baby who found my teddy bear Bobo.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 451444,
      "endMs": 455941
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "text": "And there's that Simpson mutt, my former guard dog.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 456142,
      "endMs": 459397
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "text": "And that's Bart Simpson. He was my heir for a brief period, you know.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 461310,
      "endMs": 464599
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "text": "Yes, sir. I remember.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 464766,
      "endMs": 466746
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "text": "Anything left?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 470270,
      "endMs": 471579
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "text": "Only the sour quince log, sir.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 472216,
      "endMs": 474330
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "text": "Dispose of it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 475672,
      "endMs": 476948
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "text": "And send a thank-you note to Marge, Bart, Lisa and Maggie Simpson.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 477384,
      "endMs": 482686
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "text": "Today, Springfield Elementary embarks on a new era of...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 488882,
      "endMs": 491465
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "text": "...unbridled spending where petrodollars fuel our wildest educational fantasies.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 491633,
      "endMs": 495392
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "text": "These young minds will enjoy every academic advantage...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 496159,
      "endMs": 499582
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "text": "...till they enter Springfield High School, which has no oil well.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 500119,
      "endMs": 503173
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "text": "We got an air hockey table. Fine. Now, to switch on our oil pump...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 503341,
      "endMs": 506696
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "text": "...for the very first time, here's our top student, Lisa Simpson.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 506864,
      "endMs": 511025
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "text": "Nerd!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 511227,
      "endMs": 512267
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "text": "There's no pressure.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 519347,
      "endMs": 520857
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "text": "Someone else has tapped this well. Ay caramba!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 521059,
      "endMs": 524146
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "text": "Soon that mighty apparatus will burst forth with its precious fluid.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 534750,
      "endMs": 538508
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "text": "Almost sexual, isn't it, Smithers?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 538743,
      "endMs": 540925
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "text": "Oil ho!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 543106,
      "endMs": 544683
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "text": "Huzzah!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 546596,
      "endMs": 548307
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "text": "Holy Christmas!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 574203,
      "endMs": 576753
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "text": "Your dog's condition has been upgraded from stable to frisky.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 580310,
      "endMs": 583297
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "text": "He's free to go. His leg should be good as new in a few months.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 583465,
      "endMs": 586451
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "text": "In the meantime, he'll have to use the wheel-about.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 586619,
      "endMs": 589035
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "text": "I'll get even with whoever did this to you, boy. I swear it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 589874,
      "endMs": 593599
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "text": "I almost forgot. Wouldn't want you gnawing on those casts, eh, boy?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 593867,
      "endMs": 597156
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "text": "We've got no legal recourse against Mr. Burns' slant-drilling operation.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 601317,
      "endMs": 604841
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "text": "The oil belongs to whoever pumped it first.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 605008,
      "endMs": 607055
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "text": "What about the expensive stuff we wanted? Can we still have it?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 607290,
      "endMs": 610210
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "text": "No.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 610411,
      "endMs": 611854
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "text": "Blast it!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 612928,
      "endMs": 614035
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "text": "To pay for the construction, operation and demolition of the derrick...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 614237,
      "endMs": 617693
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "text": "...we have to cut nonessential programs. Music...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 617861,
      "endMs": 620176
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "text": "What?! And maintenance.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 620411,
      "endMs": 622357
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "text": "I'll kill that Mr. Burns!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 623633,
      "endMs": 626284
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "text": "And wound that Mr. Smithers. Out of my way.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 626451,
      "endMs": 631317
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "text": "Oh, no. That's awful, Mr. Puente.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 631518,
      "endMs": 633968
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "text": "What?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 634606,
      "endMs": 635914
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "text": "He owns the nuclear power plant. Yeah, I'd like to settle his hash too.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 636082,
      "endMs": 641216
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "text": "Dad, how can you work for a man like Mr. Burns?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 641418,
      "endMs": 643700
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "text": "He's not all bad. He did send me this nice thank-you card.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 643935,
      "endMs": 646586
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "text": "\"Marge, Bart, Lisa and Maggie.\" Dad, this doesn't have your name on it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 646787,
      "endMs": 650847
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "text": "Kids, would you step outside for a second?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 654706,
      "endMs": 657525
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "text": "Dear Lord. That's the loudest profanity I've ever heard.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 663968,
      "endMs": 666820
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "text": "These fumes aren't as fun as beer. Sure, I'm all dizzy and nauseous...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 669404,
      "endMs": 673331
    },
    {
      "index": 124,
      "text": "...but where's the inflated sense of self-esteem?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 673465,
      "endMs": 676586
    },
    {
      "index": 125,
      "text": "Hey, if you guys are getting loaded off them fumes, I'll have to charge you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 680243,
      "endMs": 683867
    },
    {
      "index": 126,
      "text": "Man alive! There are men alive in here.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 684069,
      "endMs": 686820
    },
    {
      "index": 127,
      "text": "I'm detecting over 20 different toxins in the air.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 687022,
      "endMs": 690176
    },
    {
      "index": 128,
      "text": "Everybody out. As long as Burns is pumping oil, this bar is closed.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 692190,
      "endMs": 695579
    },
    {
      "index": 129,
      "text": "Damn Burns. Let me just get one thing.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 695780,
      "endMs": 699237
    },
    {
      "index": 130,
      "text": "Me too. Now, there's the inflated sense of self-esteem.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 700847,
      "endMs": 707089
    },
    {
      "index": 131,
      "text": "Earthquake!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 717223,
      "endMs": 719337
    },
    {
      "index": 132,
      "text": "Nurse! Nurse! Nurse!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 724404,
      "endMs": 726418
    },
    {
      "index": 133,
      "text": "Well, sir, you've vanquished all your enemies.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 735176,
      "endMs": 737257
    },
    {
      "index": 134,
      "text": "The elementary school, local tavern, the old-age home. You must be proud.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 737425,
      "endMs": 741451
    },
    {
      "index": 135,
      "text": "No, not while my greatest nemesis still provides our customers...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 741653,
      "endMs": 745042
    },
    {
      "index": 136,
      "text": "...with free light, heat and energy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 745210,
      "endMs": 747022
    },
    {
      "index": 137,
      "text": "I call this enemy... the sun.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 747525,
      "endMs": 750914
    },
    {
      "index": 138,
      "text": "Since the beginning of time, man has yearned to destroy the sun.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 759639,
      "endMs": 762659
    },
    {
      "index": 139,
      "text": "I will do the next best thing: Block it out.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 762861,
      "endMs": 767055
    },
    {
      "index": 140,
      "text": "Good God! Imagine it, Smithers.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 771586,
      "endMs": 773901
    },
    {
      "index": 141,
      "text": "Electrical lights and heaters running all day long.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 774069,
      "endMs": 776988
    },
    {
      "index": 142,
      "text": "But, sir, every plant and tree will die.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 777223,
      "endMs": 779505
    },
    {
      "index": 143,
      "text": "Owls will deafen us with incessant hooting. The sundial will be useless.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 779706,
      "endMs": 783431
    },
    {
      "index": 144,
      "text": "I don't want any part of this project. It's unconscionably fiendish.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 784740,
      "endMs": 789002
    },
    {
      "index": 145,
      "text": "I won't suffer your insubordination.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 789169,
      "endMs": 790646
    },
    {
      "index": 146,
      "text": "There has been a shocking decline in the quality and quantity of your toadying.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 790814,
      "endMs": 794505
    },
    {
      "index": 147,
      "text": "And you will fall into line. Now!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 794740,
      "endMs": 796485
    },
    {
      "index": 148,
      "text": "No. No, Monty, I won't.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 797257,
      "endMs": 799673
    },
    {
      "index": 149,
      "text": "Not until you step back from the brink of insanity.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 799874,
      "endMs": 802492
    },
    {
      "index": 150,
      "text": "I'll do no such thing. You're fired.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 802693,
      "endMs": 805948
    },
    {
      "index": 151,
      "text": "Take that, Bowl-a-rama. Take that, convenience mart.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 813324,
      "endMs": 815807
    },
    {
      "index": 152,
      "text": "Take that, nuclear power pla...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 816008,
      "endMs": 818190
    },
    {
      "index": 153,
      "text": "Oh, fiddlesticks.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 818794,
      "endMs": 820069
    },
    {
      "index": 154,
      "text": "I must say, Mr. Burns is being awfully inconsiderate. Selfish, even.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 824475,
      "endMs": 828367
    },
    {
      "index": 155,
      "text": "Burns needs some serious \"boostafazoo.\" Right, Dad?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 828569,
      "endMs": 831522
    },
    {
      "index": 156,
      "text": "Dad. Homer.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 832193,
      "endMs": 834609
    },
    {
      "index": 157,
      "text": "Sorry, Grampa. It's just, for a second, it looked like Dad had melted.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 836757,
      "endMs": 839978
    },
    {
      "index": 158,
      "text": "Well, get used to it, because I'm living here now.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 840146,
      "endMs": 842461
    },
    {
      "index": 159,
      "text": "I ain't going back to the home until they fish my bed out of that sinkhole.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 842629,
      "endMs": 846555
    },
    {
      "index": 160,
      "text": "Strained carrots for Maggie. Strained carrots for Grampa.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 846723,
      "endMs": 849810
    },
    {
      "index": 161,
      "text": "I want a bib too.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 850012,
      "endMs": 851522
    },
    {
      "index": 162,
      "text": "Smithers, who is that ignoramus? Smithers, who is that lollygagger?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 852763,
      "endMs": 855951
    },
    {
      "index": 163,
      "text": "Who is that blubber-pot? Who is that bafflewit?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 856119,
      "endMs": 858334
    },
    {
      "index": 164,
      "text": "Lummox. Puddinghead. Mooncalf. Limpnoodle.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 858502,
      "endMs": 860414
    },
    {
      "index": 165,
      "text": "Goldbricker. Drizzlepuss...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 860582,
      "endMs": 861857
    },
    {
      "index": 166,
      "text": "Stop it. Stop it. Stop it! Look out!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 862025,
      "endMs": 864643
    },
    {
      "index": 167,
      "text": "What?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 864844,
      "endMs": 865985
    },
    {
      "index": 168,
      "text": "Just a minute.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 868267,
      "endMs": 870817
    },
    {
      "index": 169,
      "text": "Who the devil are you?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 882428,
      "endMs": 884005
    },
    {
      "index": 170,
      "text": "Homer Simpson. What? What are you talking about?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 886455,
      "endMs": 889005
    },
    {
      "index": 171,
      "text": "Homer Simpson. Make sense, man.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 889173,
      "endMs": 890683
    },
    {
      "index": 172,
      "text": "I can't understand a word you're saying. My name is Homer Simpson.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 890817,
      "endMs": 894978
    },
    {
      "index": 173,
      "text": "Oh, you're a dead man, Burns. Oh, you're dead. You're dead, Burns!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 895146,
      "endMs": 898938
    },
    {
      "index": 174,
      "text": "Hey, the lamp's running away. That's my dog, man.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 899878,
      "endMs": 903468
    },
    {
      "index": 175,
      "text": "So long, lamp. Now, stop loafing and help your Grampa unpack.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 903636,
      "endMs": 907965
    },
    {
      "index": 176,
      "text": "That's my old Smith & Wesson.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 910683,
      "endMs": 912797
    },
    {
      "index": 177,
      "text": "If you're gonna play with it, be careful. It's loaded.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 912965,
      "endMs": 915582
    },
    {
      "index": 178,
      "text": "Bart, put that down!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 916052,
      "endMs": 917327
    },
    {
      "index": 179,
      "text": "Guns are dangerous. And I won't have them in this house.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 917562,
      "endMs": 920180
    },
    {
      "index": 180,
      "text": "How can you have a house without a gun?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 921920,
      "endMs": 924067
    },
    {
      "index": 181,
      "text": "What if a bear came through the door?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 924235,
      "endMs": 926047
    },
    {
      "index": 182,
      "text": "I'm going to bury it in the yard where little hands can't get to it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 927423,
      "endMs": 930645
    },
    {
      "index": 183,
      "text": "You should've fired into the air. She would've run off.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 930947,
      "endMs": 933497
    },
    {
      "index": 184,
      "text": "People, take it easy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 936148,
      "endMs": 938161
    },
    {
      "index": 185,
      "text": "We're all upset about Mr. Burns' plan to block out our sun.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 938363,
      "endMs": 941920
    },
    {
      "index": 186,
      "text": "It is time for decisive action.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 942155,
      "endMs": 944537
    },
    {
      "index": 187,
      "text": "I have here a polite but firm letter to Mr. Burns' underlings...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 944739,
      "endMs": 948195
    },
    {
      "index": 188,
      "text": "...who, with some cajoling, will pass it along to him...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 948396,
      "endMs": 951685
    },
    {
      "index": 189,
      "text": "...or at least give him the gist of it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 951853,
      "endMs": 953833
    },
    {
      "index": 190,
      "text": "Sir, a lot of people are stroking guns.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 954000,
      "endMs": 955745
    },
    {
      "index": 191,
      "text": "It has been brought to my attention a number of you are stroking guns.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 955913,
      "endMs": 959135
    },
    {
      "index": 192,
      "text": "Therefore I'll step aside and open up the floor.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 959302,
      "endMs": 961517
    },
    {
      "index": 193,
      "text": "Mr. Burns was the closest thing I ever had to a friend.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 961718,
      "endMs": 966148
    },
    {
      "index": 194,
      "text": "But he fired me.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 966718,
      "endMs": 967994
    },
    {
      "index": 195,
      "text": "And now I spend my days drinking cheap Scotch and watching Comedy Central.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 968161,
      "endMs": 971886
    },
    {
      "index": 196,
      "text": "Oh, dear God. I lost my bar. - I lost his bar.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 972121,
      "endMs": 976323
    },
    {
      "index": 197,
      "text": "He robbed the school of music.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 976470,
      "endMs": 978114
    },
    {
      "index": 198,
      "text": "He robbed it of financial security. He robbed the school of Tito.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 978282,
      "endMs": 981369
    },
    {
      "index": 199,
      "text": "He can't remember my name! He's causing us all to yell!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 981537,
      "endMs": 984356
    },
    {
      "index": 200,
      "text": "Look what he did to my best friend.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 985430,
      "endMs": 987242
    },
    {
      "index": 201,
      "text": "No, my dog.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 989088,
      "endMs": 990598
    },
    {
      "index": 202,
      "text": "Those wheels are squeaking a bit.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 997846,
      "endMs": 1000296
    },
    {
      "index": 203,
      "text": "Perhaps I could sell him a little oil.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1000497,
      "endMs": 1002477
    },
    {
      "index": 204,
      "text": "You twisted old monster!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1004390,
      "endMs": 1006470
    },
    {
      "index": 205,
      "text": "I've decided to protect myself...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1010027,
      "endMs": 1011739
    },
    {
      "index": 206,
      "text": "...ever since I was attacked in my office by an unidentified assailant.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1011940,
      "endMs": 1015430
    },
    {
      "index": 207,
      "text": "Burns, your scurvy schemes will earn ye a one-way passage to the boneyard.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1017242,
      "endMs": 1021672
    },
    {
      "index": 208,
      "text": "I'd like to hear from Sideshow Mel.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1021873,
      "endMs": 1023886
    },
    {
      "index": 209,
      "text": "I'll see that Mr. Burns suffers the infernal machinations of hell's grim tyrant.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1024088,
      "endMs": 1029994
    },
    {
      "index": 210,
      "text": "Yeah. Oh, you all talk big.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1030161,
      "endMs": 1032712
    },
    {
      "index": 211,
      "text": "But who here has the guts to stop me?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1033081,
      "endMs": 1036302
    },
    {
      "index": 212,
      "text": "Very well. One last question.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1041638,
      "endMs": 1044054
    },
    {
      "index": 213,
      "text": "Have you ever seen the sun set at 3 p. M?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1044255,
      "endMs": 1048685
    },
    {
      "index": 214,
      "text": "Once, when I was sailing around the Arctic...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1050157,
      "endMs": 1052607
    },
    {
      "index": 215,
      "text": "Shut up, you. Take one last look at the sun, Springfield.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1052775,
      "endMs": 1057171
    },
    {
      "index": 216,
      "text": "Hey, hey!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1077473,
      "endMs": 1078849
    },
    {
      "index": 217,
      "text": "I've been in Reno for six weeks. Did I miss anything?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1079889,
      "endMs": 1082876
    },
    {
      "index": 218,
      "text": "What the...?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1083077,
      "endMs": 1084084
    },
    {
      "index": 219,
      "text": "Eternal darkness. Well, that's just great.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1086869,
      "endMs": 1090157
    },
    {
      "index": 220,
      "text": "Listen, someone's got to get that Mr. Burns.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1090325,
      "endMs": 1092506
    },
    {
      "index": 221,
      "text": "Where's a gun-toting lowlife when you need one?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1092708,
      "endMs": 1095225
    },
    {
      "index": 222,
      "text": "Sorry, I was in the can.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1095392,
      "endMs": 1097238
    },
    {
      "index": 223,
      "text": "Perpetual twilight. Bathed in the glow of Burns brand electricity.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1100963,
      "endMs": 1105761
    },
    {
      "index": 224,
      "text": "Hello, lamppost. What you knowing?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1106869,
      "endMs": 1109553
    },
    {
      "index": 225,
      "text": "I've come to watch your power flowing.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1109755,
      "endMs": 1113110
    },
    {
      "index": 226,
      "text": "That's odd. Mr. Smithers left his jacket behind.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1115728,
      "endMs": 1118211
    },
    {
      "index": 227,
      "text": "That's odd. Principal Skinner left his mother behind.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1121131,
      "endMs": 1124318
    },
    {
      "index": 228,
      "text": "That's odd. Where's Homer? And Bart? And Lisa? And Grampa?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1130594,
      "endMs": 1134822
    },
    {
      "index": 229,
      "text": "After all these years, things are finally starting to go my way.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1140392,
      "endMs": 1144151
    },
    {
      "index": 230,
      "text": "I feel like celebrating.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1144889,
      "endMs": 1146500
    },
    {
      "index": 231,
      "text": "Oh, it's you. What are you so happy about?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1147607,
      "endMs": 1149822
    },
    {
      "index": 232,
      "text": "I see. I think you'd better drop it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1150493,
      "endMs": 1153379
    },
    {
      "index": 233,
      "text": "I said, drop it!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1153647,
      "endMs": 1156030
    },
    {
      "index": 234,
      "text": "Get your hands off.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1158010,
      "endMs": 1161332
    },
    {
      "index": 235,
      "text": "Where is everybody?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1161533,
      "endMs": 1163580
    },
    {
      "index": 236,
      "text": "Hey, man. Are you okay?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1168775,
      "endMs": 1171359
    },
    {
      "index": 237,
      "text": "Won't... dignify that... with a response.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1172768,
      "endMs": 1176661
    },
    {
      "index": 238,
      "text": "Mr. Burns has been shot.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1179647,
      "endMs": 1181459
    },
    {
      "index": 239,
      "text": "Just a minute. This isn't Mr. Burns at all.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1181627,
      "endMs": 1184882
    },
    {
      "index": 240,
      "text": "It's a mask.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1185084,
      "endMs": 1186392
    },
    {
      "index": 241,
      "text": "Oh, wait, it is Burns.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1190016,
      "endMs": 1191560
    },
    {
      "index": 242,
      "text": "His wrinkly skin looks like a mask.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1192097,
      "endMs": 1193808
    },
    {
      "index": 243,
      "text": "I don't think we'll ever know who did this. Everyone in town's a suspect.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1194010,
      "endMs": 1198439
    },
    {
      "index": 244,
      "text": "Well, I couldn't possibly solve this mystery.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1206594,
      "endMs": 1208976
    },
    {
      "index": 245,
      "text": "Can you?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1209345,
      "endMs": 1211761
    },
    {
      "index": 246,
      "text": "Yeah, I'll give it a shot. I mean, you know, it's my job, right? www.tvsubtitles.net",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1213674,
      "endMs": 2000
    }
  ],
